  "description": "College student \"Sa-Na\" wakes up in the Body of \"Isana Castilla\" of the Titan Empire, sentenced to burn at the stake for practicing witchcraft! A chance encounter with Ludwig, the Crown Prince leads her on a path to become Empress, as she embarks on a journey to help the now Emperor combat evil rivals! What lies in store for the new Empress and her little secret? Will she manage to find her way back home?\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS, edited)",
